1
00:00:00,500 --> 00:00:03,889
Every year India produces about
1.1 crore graduates.

2
00:00:03,939 --> 00:00:06,337
Only about half are judged job-ready,

3
00:00:06,387 --> 00:00:09,776
and IT fresher hiring has fallen
80% in three years.

4
00:00:09,826 --> 00:00:15,067
Most of these students think in Telugu or
Hindi, but are taught only in English.

5
00:00:15,467 --> 00:00:20,218
Platforms already teach coding in Indian
languages; NxtWave and GUVI do this well.

6
00:00:20,268 --> 00:00:23,672
Testing platforms like HackerRank
check skills, in English.

7
00:00:23,722 --> 00:00:28,414
But no one teaches the way students actually
speak and then proves the skill in a

8
00:00:28,464 --> 00:00:30,814
record that colleges and employers trust.

9
00:00:31,214 --> 00:00:33,814
Qubirex is a learning-to-hiring platform.

10
00:00:33,864 --> 00:00:38,531
Professor Qubirex teaches each line in
Telugu, Hindi or the everyday mix.

11
00:00:38,581 --> 00:00:42,796
Students practise with real tests, a
fresh check proves the skill,

12
00:00:42,846 --> 00:00:47,125
and it goes on a signed Capability
Passport that anyone can verify.

13
00:00:47,525 --> 00:00:52,797
Three things set us apart: proof, not
completion certificates; tools for colleges,

14
00:00:52,847 --> 00:00:57,793
not just courses for students; and one record
from first lesson to job offer.

15
00:00:58,193 --> 00:01:01,565
Pilot results will be added here: the
score before and after,

16
00:01:01,615 --> 00:01:04,538
how many students took part, and
over how many weeks.

17
00:01:04,938 --> 00:01:08,993
Who pays will be added here, for each of
our three customers: colleges,

18
00:01:09,043 --> 00:01:10,323
employers and students.

19
00:01:10,723 --> 00:01:13,572
Our price per student, our AI
cost per learner,

20
00:01:13,622 --> 00:01:17,951
and the expected gross margin will be
added here, from real usage logs.

21
00:01:18,351 --> 00:01:20,238
India approved 14.9 lakh BTech
seats in 2024-25.

22
00:01:20,288 --> 00:01:22,255
We start in Andhra Pradesh and
Telangana: about 1.

23
00:01:22,305 --> 00:01:25,644
8 lakh seats in Andhra Pradesh and about 1.2
lakh in Telangana. [FILL: first target,

24
00:01:25,694 --> 00:01:27,904
e.g. 50 colleges x 600 students x
price = Rs __ a year.]

25
00:01:28,304 --> 00:01:33,412
Traction will be added here: our pilots,
letters of intent and colleges in talks.

26
00:01:33,462 --> 00:01:35,895
Then a line on each person in the team.

27
00:01:36,295 --> 00:01:42,535
Our funding ask will be added here: how much
we are raising, what it will reach,

28
00:01:42,585 --> 00:01:47,881
and how we will use it across product,
sales and content. Thank you.
